            "caption": "OpenFilm: Your Agent's New Video Trick OpenFilm is the open source tool that lets your coding agent make actual movies. It turns any AI helper into a video creator by writing films as simple web pages you can edit right in your browser. Instead of wrestling with heavy software, you just ask your agent to make a clip, and it builds it using code it already knows. The coolest part is the built in editor where you can tweak every single detail by hand or let the agent keep going. It’s like having a film crew in your pocket, all running locally on your machine. Open source: https://github.com/openfilm/openfilm Spotted on Hacker News: https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50152136 #TextToVideo #AIVideoEditing #MotionGraphics #AICoding #CodingAgents",
