            "caption": "Build Your Own AI Agent Office with Munder Difflin Want to run your own office of AI agents? Meet Munder Difflin, a local multi-agent harness designed to help you coordinate, manage, and orchestrate complex agent workflows right from your terminal. It solves the chaos of handling multiple AI coding sessions by providing a structured framework for team-like collaboration, complete with role-based agent manifests and task management. Whether you need automated code reviews or specialized data analysis, this project gives you the tools to build reliable, long-running agent swarms locally. Dive in to explore how you can automate your development tasks and scale your intelligent agent operations today. Open source: chaitanyagiri/munder-difflin Follow for more open source project drops. #aiagents #claudecode  #codingagents",
